OL,3,GNEWSATheft of church Pride banner
OL,4,Areported as hate crime
OL,5,
OL,6,FA vicar has spoken of her sadness after
OL,7,Fa welcome banner for new students which
OL,8,Ffeatured the Pride flag was cut down
OL,9,Fand stolen by a member of the public.
OL,11,FThe Reverend Helena Roulston from St
OL,12,FMark's Church in the Sheffield suburb
OL,13,Fof Broomhill said the incident had been
OL,14,Freported as a hate crime.
OL,16,FThe church is popular with young people
OL,17,Fand had erected the banner to welcome
OL,18,Fnew students to the city five days
OL,19,Fbefore it was taken away in broad
OL,20,Fdaylight on 21 September.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
