OL,3,GNEWSATheft of church Pride banner
OL,4,Areported as hate crime
OL,5,
OL,6,FRoulston said the news "came as quite a
OL,7,Fshock", but revealed members of the
OL,8,Fchurch's congregation had told her it
OL,9,Fwas not the first time Pride flags
OL,10,Fdisplayed outside the church had been
OL,11,Ftaken down.
